Z||000000||bHooper||01-25-2000||07:18 AM||||it's 7 am here in Greensboro, NC... and a foot of snow has droped on us since the Oilers lost in OT to the Predators!  This is piedmont NC, we're not supposed to get weather like this.  It has snowed, sleated or snowed every two days for the past week!<P>Two weeks ago, I was skipping out on work early to go mountain bike rideing.  And now <BR>it's like I'm in freaking Minnesota!<P>Don't get me wrong... I luv this stuff!  Can't get enough of it!  But it's been 4 years since we had any snow!  This is wierd...<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/snowonthejeep.jpg"> <BR><p>[This message has been edited by bHooper (edited 01-25-2000).]||||reg||10
